 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u00563",
   "en": "Personal data recorder for Major Elena Flores.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00564",
   "en": "Sigma-23 is almost fully operational. The barracks and storage lockers are complete, and we've begun stocking the munitions.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00565",
   "en": "This is a familiar story. A failed experiment with the rachni. Nice to see humans are consistently stupid.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00566",
   "en": "Another batch of experimental rachni get loose. These things need warning labels.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00567",
   "en": "A rachni experiment gone awry. Again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00568",
   "en": "It seems Binary Helix were not the only ones foolish enough to meddle with the rachni.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00569",
   "en": "Experiments on the rachni. Failed containment. Didn't we just leave this party?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00570",
   "en": "It's highly unlikely the Alliance will patrol in the nebula. I expect our only risk will be from pirates. And who'll believe them?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00571",
   "en": "Looks like we'll have space for two reinforced platoons of Cerberus commandos.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00572",
   "en": "Cerberus. Damn. We should have known.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00573",
   "en": "Cerberus. I've about had it with those guys.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00574",
   "en": "Cerberus may be a bigger threat than we had assumed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00575",
   "en": "Cerberus may be a bigger threat than we'd assumed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00576",
   "en": "Cerberus? Is that a corporation?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00577",
   "en": "Cerberus? I do not think I have heard of that organization before.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00578",
   "en": "The package arrived today for field testing. I'm told they're fundamentally similar to the units being developed on Noveria.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00579",
   "en": "They promise this batch will be stable. Something about them developing in proximity to the master control unit.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00580",
   "en": "We detected some pirates setting up an anchorage in a neighboring system. I think we'll try deploying them there first.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00581",
   "en": "They've escaped containment. Clever bastards. We treated them like animals. We should've treated them like P.O.W.s.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00582",
   "en": "They're spreading. Boarding the supply ships and sending them to random destinations. They'll be all over the cluster in a week.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00583",
   "en": "General, if you recover this message, my advice is: screw the rachni. They're too smart. Use one of the other projects. Flores, signing off... for the final time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00584",
   "en": "Play the first entry.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_FRE35_00_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00585",
   "en": "Play the second entry.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
